  "fullDescription": "Minimalist Christmas Reindeer STL File\n\nBring a cozy Scandinavian-inspired holiday feel to your home with this **Minimalist Christmas Reindeer STL** set. Featuring three elegant reindeer figures with smooth rounded bodies, graceful antlers, and sculptural ribbed details, this design is perfect for creating a warm and modern Christmas display.\n\n**Perfect For:**\nChristmas home decor, holiday shelf styling, winter decorations, mantel displays, tabletop decor, Scandinavian Christmas decor, nursery decor, festive gift ideas, and seasonal 3D printing projects.\n\n**Color Customization:**\nThe models can be colored using software such as Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, Cura, or other compatible slicer software, allowing you to customize the bodies, hats, pom-poms, beaks, eyes, polka dots, textured sections, and other details with your preferred colors.\n\n**Note:** This is a digital STL file set, not a physical product. A compatible 3D printer is required to create the physical models.",
